  "label": "Photography as Memory Preservation",
  "description": "The act of taking a photo is culturally understood as a method to preserve moments and memories. This concept is not visually depicted but is essential to understand why the group is posing and why the text 'taking a photo with family' is used — it implies a desire to capture and cherish a shared experience.",
